laura-smalley-01
00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.850
<v Laura Smalley>You know, and old master didn't tell you
know, they was free.</v>

laura-smalley-02
00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.080
<v John Henry Faulk>He didn't tell you that?</v>

laura-smalley-03
00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.240
<v Laura Smalley>Uh-uh. No he didn't tell.</v>

laura-smalley-04
00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:46.800
<v Laura Smalley>They worked there, I think now they say</v>

laura-smalley-05
00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:51.250
<v Laura Smalley>they worked them, six months after that. Six
months.</v>

laura-smalley-06
00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:53.950
<v Laura Smalley>And turn them loose on the nineteenth of
June.</v>

laura-smalley-07
00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:57.170
<v Laura Smalley>That's why, you know, we celebrate that day.</v>

laura-smalley-08
00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:00.150
<v Laura Smalley>Colored folks—celebrates that day.</v>
